  "48": {
   "type": "Content",
   "is_root": "0",
   "node_name": "claude.md",
   "page_title": "claude.md",
   "content": "<p>claude.md - Networks reply form (demo), INT org 123.</p><p>Purpose: a merchant who was asked for the invoice amount and Merchant Number answers through this form instead of replying to the email, so the answer lands on the existing case (no threading needed). Fields per Charley Gunning 4 Nov: Case number (hidden), Invoice Amount, Merchant ID Number.</p><p>Link: https://eu.zingtree.com/show/&lt;tree id&gt;?sf_Id=&lt;Case Id&gt;. sf_Id is the only input.</p><p>Nodes: 1 get case (CO 10 sfdc_int__case_email_ai) -&gt; 2 found? -&gt; 3 router -&gt; 4 form -&gt; 5 build email -&gt; 6 send (CO 187 send_email_simple_int, relatedRecordId sf_Id, logEmailOnSend) -&gt; 7 grade -&gt; 8 router -&gt; 10 thanks / 11 failed. 9 link not valid.</p><p>Send CO 187 body reads by name: transforms.email_subject_json, transforms.email_body_json, transforms.ccAddresses (JSON text, [] here), ai_email_from_address, sf_Id, actions.sfdc_int__case_email_ai.records[0].SuppliedEmail - all set by nodes 1 / 5.</p><p>Open: no-reply sender (Alex / Gemma 5 Nov) needs a verified OrgWideEmailAddress from Corpay - sender is networksupport@ for the demo. Confirmation copy is demo text, not approved. PROD needs the get_case_details__prod / send_email_simple_prod remap.</p><p>2026-11-05: built for the 6 Nov demo.</p>",
